  "description": "Dependency-free reader and writer for Apple QuickDraw PICT pictures (v1, v2 and extended v2) that draws exactly the pixels a Macintosh draws: a software QuickDraw engine (shapes, regions, patterns, transfer modes, CopyBits scaling, bitmap and color-bitmap-font text) modelled on Mac OS 9 or the 68k ROM, optional 1-16 bit screen depths with QuickDraw's color matching and dithering, built-in QuickTime codecs (raw, Animation, Road Pizza, Graphics, Cinepak and more), QTIF and MacPaint files, and icon, cursor and pattern resources. Writes indexed, 16-bit and 32-bit pictures with resolution and ICC profiles.",
